  "description": "Intent: Block-tier hard enforcement on Web clipboard paste and upload into the Unauthorized Webmail and Calendar surface at sensitivity floor [3,4] — shuts down attachment-based exfil into personal webmail (gmail.com, yahoo.com, outlook.com). Exclusions: excludes domains in Websites_Authorized_Webmail_Domains_[is] and users in Users_Authorized_Internal_User_Suffixes_[ends_with]; ships disabled — enable after corporate webmail is in the Authorized list and W1071 is clean. Requirements: WIP — pending analyst testing.",
